# Shopify storefront. Public product, collection, page, blog, policy, cart, and localized HTML is crawlable.
# Agent instructions: https://www.ativafit.com/agents.md
# LLM context: https://www.ativafit.com/llms.txt
# UCP discovery: https://www.ativafit.com/.well-known/ucp
# UCP/MCP endpoint: Agents should use the endpoint returned by the UCP discovery document.
# Current UCP discovery may return: https://ativafit-tech.myshopify.com/api/ucp/mcp
