#
# Checkouts are for humans. Do NOT complete checkout, payment, or order placement automatically.
# Agents transacting on a buyer's behalf must use UCP/MCP or the Shopify shopping skill.
# Payment requires explicit, contemporaneous buyer approval.
# Shop skill: https://shop.app/SKILL.md
# Terms of Service: https://www.shopify.com/legal/terms
# Contact: bots@shopify.com

